#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:3
msgid ""
"当前代码采用统一物理目录、TOML 静态装配、typed factory 和共享多态方法表。 公共 C11 face 只保存 readonly ops "
"与私有 context；每个实例拥有独立状态，request 和 block storage 由调用者提供。SDK 和 provider storage"
" 私有，应用产品工程独立。 这里的设计合同与 [当前交付](../delivery/README.md) 一起使用，历史文档不建立当前资格。"
msgstr ""
"Current code uses unified physical directories, TOML static assembly, typed "
"factories and shared polymorphic tables. Public C11 faces contain only read-"
"only ops and private context. Each instance owns independent state; callers "
"supply request and block storage. SDKs/provider storage remain private and "
"product projects external. Use these design contracts together with [current"
" delivery](../delivery/README.md); historical documents establish no current"
" qualification."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:8
msgid ""
"五项有界软件增量的装配、借用与恢复责任见[映射存储、AMP、镜像交接、RTC 与帧边界](io-extension-"
"boundaries.md)。完整原始退出条件与实板状态保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"For assembly, borrow and recovery responsibilities of five bounded software "
"increments, see [mapped storage, AMP, image handoff, RTC and frame "
"boundaries](io-extension-boundaries.md). The complete original exit "
"conditions and hardware status remain unchanged."

