#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:77
msgid ""
"CPU 软件层覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85，通过显式 CPU/IRQ facts 选择原子后端、ABI、可选 "
"FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/SAU 与裸机/FreeRTOS port。外部 CPU runtime 不生成 "
"SoC/Board/factory；ThreadX 另有明确的 Native/M4 子集，不能继承 九核 FreeRTOS port "
"范围。配置示例与剩余条件见 [九核支持说明](../delivery/cortex-m.md)。这不扩大完整平台的芯片/板卡范围。"
msgstr ""
"CPU software covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85, selecting atomic "
"backends, ABI, optional FPU/MVE/cache/MPU/SAU and baremetal/FreeRTOS ports "
"through explicit CPU/IRQ facts. External CPU runtime generates no "
"SoC/Board/factory. ThreadX maintains a separate explicit Native/M4 subset "
"and inherits no nine-core FreeRTOS scope. See [nine-core "
"support](../delivery/cortex-m.md) for configurations and outstanding "
"conditions. This does not expand whole-platform chip/board scope."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:83
msgid ""
"首发为启明STM32F407ZGT6、天空星STM32F407VET6和梁山派GD32F470ZGT6，裸机/ FreeRTOS、显式 ThreadX "
"及 Native 模型。新增 F103RBT6／GD32F303RCT6 参考及 G474／H743／U575 增量按各文档的精确配置、完整镜像与 "
"SDK 退出条件验收，不从公共 类型推断完整系列或全部外设。F103/GD303 增加有限 UART channel-DMA、I2C IRQ、 物理 "
"Flash、单次 ADC 与固定 PWM；GD303 另维护 EXTI 和硬件级联 timebase。 G474 的既有 "
"GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI 之外，选入 bulb ADC 单次／有限 TIM6 DMA、I2C1 和 ECC "
"Flash。H743 的固定 HSI/cache 支持有限 TX DMA 或有 rearm 间隙的 RX block，可显式初始化 D2 "
"SRAM1；独立 V／HSI64／裸机参考在 Cache off/on 下增加 SPI4 有限 DMA 和 USART3 连续双缓冲 RX。`rx-"
"dma-continuous` 保留独立 IRQ TX；另选 `dma-duplex-continuous` 才增加有限 TX DMA。新双向模式只接入"
" AXI SRAM， RX 使用至少三个等长 block，不能推导为 FreeRTOS、PLL384 或 D2 SRAM 支持；另有 "
"七类有限外设的软件夹具。U575 TZEN0 增加 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash，外部电源与安全状态准入仍适用。 独立无 OS "
"的 TZEN1 GPIO 参考可复制最多八条命令到 Secure slot，再由调用者逐步 推进；不保留 NS 指针，不代表通用双域 "
"factory、NS RTOS 或异步借用。 ECC `program_flags`、fresh-erase 来源与逐脉冲完成责任见公共 Flash "
"合同；当前源 实现和最终集成资格分别记录，不继承历史执行计数。 SOC-33 的有限软件增量见上述边界页，完整退出仍开放；SOC-34 "
"运行态变频仍未实现。 SOC-35 新增 [U575 保留时间参考](u575-retained-time.md)的有界软件子集：独立 RTC "
"时间域、显式 WUT/Stop2 owner 与失败保留排空；默认 Core TIM2 停止后旧 deadline 失效。另有同一 owner 的选定 "
"[SRAM4/LPDMA 有限复制](u575-stop2-copy.md)；通用外设 "
"LPBAM、物理复制/保留/精度/功耗/唤醒验收及完整退出仍开放； SOC-36 保留 partial，SOC-37–55 的物理验收仍为 "
"not_executed。 三Board未审实物PCB事实仍标unknown；软件测试夹具不升格真实 "
"Board路线。角色沿用十人配置：TL1、Core/I/O/OS2、BSP2、通用应用/通信2、QA/HIL2、 "
"构建发布1；维护责任由Codex全部承担，无需实名人员。远程branch protection状态 须通过GitHub独立核实，不能从本地角色文件推断。"
msgstr ""
"First-release references are Qiming STM32F407ZGT6, Sky STM32F407VET6 and "
"Liangshan GD32F470ZGT6, with baremetal/FreeRTOS, explicit ThreadX and Native"
" models. New F103RBT6/GD32F303RCT6 references and G474/H743/U575 increments "
"follow each contract's exact configuration, complete-image and SDK exits; "
"public types do not imply whole-family or all-peripheral support. F103/GD303"
" add finite UART channel-DMA, IRQ I2C, physical Flash, single-shot ADC and "
"fixed PWM. GD303 also maintains EXTI and a hardware-cascaded timebase. G474 "
"adds bulb ADC shots/finite TIM6 DMA, I2C1 and ECC Flash beside "
"GPIO/UART/SPI/PWM/IWDG/EXTI. H743 fixed HSI/Cache supports finite TX DMA or "
"RX blocks with rearm gaps and explicitly initialized D2 SRAM1. Separate "
"V/HSI64/baremetal references add finite SPI4 DMA and continuous double-"
"buffered USART3 RX with Cache off/on. `rx-dma-continuous` retains "
"independent IRQ TX; only the separately selected `dma-duplex-continuous` "
"adds finite TX DMA. The new duplex mode admits only AXI SRAM, with at least "
"three equal RX blocks; it does not imply FreeRTOS, PLL384 or D2 SRAM "
"support. Seven other finite peripheral classes have software fixtures. U575 "
"TZEN0 adds SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash with external supply and security-"
"state admission. Its independent no-OS TZEN1 GPIO reference copies up to "
"eight commands into a Secure slot for caller-driven progress; it retains no "
"NS pointer and does not provide a generic dual-world factory, NS RTOS or "
"asynchronous borrow. The public Flash contract owns ECC `program_flags`, "
"fresh-erase provenance and per-pulse completion. Current implementation and "
"final integrated qualification are recorded separately without inherited "
"historical counts. The bounded SOC-33 software increment is described by the"
" boundary page above; its complete exits remain open. SOC-34 running "
"frequency changes remain unimplemented. SOC-35 adds the bounded [U575 "
"retained-time reference](u575-retained-time.md): an independent RTC domain, "
"explicit WUT/Stop2 owner and retained failed-drain ownership. Old default "
"Core TIM2 deadlines become invalid after stop. A separately selected [finite"
" SRAM4/LPDMA copy](u575-stop2-copy.md) uses the same owner; general "
"peripheral LPBAM, physical copy/retention/precision/power/wake acceptance "
"and the complete exit remain open. SOC-36 remains partial, and SOC-37–55 "
"physical acceptance not_executed. Unobserved PCB facts for the three Boards "
"remain unknown; software fixtures do not become actual Board routes. The "
"ten-person capacity model remains TL1, Core/I/O/OS2, BSP2, common "
"applications/communications2, QA/HIL2 and build/release1. Codex owns all "
"maintenance without requiring named accounts. Remote branch protection must "
"be independently observed through GitHub rather than inferred from local "
"role files."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:111
msgid ""
"另有独立选定的 [LPTIM1 单组 LPBAM](u575-lptim1-lpbam.md)：一组 SRAM4 CCR1/RCR=0/ARR 经 "
"LPDMA1 channel0 更新专用 LPTIM1。它沿用同一 concrete Stop2 owner，公开 start/stop "
"保留部分启动失败的归还责任；通用 LPBAM、引脚路线与 实板验收不由该软件切片建立，原 IO-32/SOC-35 退出条件不变。"
msgstr ""
"The separately selected [single-tuple LPTIM1 LPBAM](u575-lptim1-lpbam.md) "
"updates dedicated LPTIM1 from one SRAM4 CCR1/RCR=0/ARR tuple through LPDMA1 "
"channel0. It uses the same concrete Stop2 owner; public start/stop retain "
"restoration responsibility after partial startup failure. This software "
"slice establishes no general LPBAM, pin route or physical acceptance, and "
"leaves the original IO-32/SOC-35 exit conditions unchanged."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/design/README.md:116
msgid ""
"行为变更采用 RED → GREEN → REFACTOR；主机 GoogleTest/GoogleMock 测试真实生产 "
"provider、factory 与 owner，配置工具用 Python unittest。commit hook 和 CI 执行同一 门禁，生产 "
"MCU target 不链接测试框架。构建期资源验证、实际寄存器模型、ARM ELF 预算与物理 HIL 分别建立证据，方法表开销由实际 linked "
"image 测量。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior changes follow RED → GREEN → REFACTOR. Host GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"tests execute real providers, factories and owners; configuration tools use "
"Python unittest. Commit hooks and CI run the same gate; MCU targets link no "
"test frameworks. Build-time resources, actual register models, ARM ELF "
"budgets and physical HIL establish separate evidence; actual linked images "
"measure method-table overhead."

